---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="bg-brand-navy text-white pt-32 pb-24 px-8 border-b border-gray-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-start">
      <h1
        class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-heading mb-6 leading-tight text-brand-green"
      >
        Tomkinson Carpets
      </h1>

      <p
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-body max-w-4xl text-white leading-relaxed"
      >
        A unified identity under a stronger name. Moving from a dual-branded
        past to a single, confident identity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Project Overview -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-24 px-8 border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16">
      <div class="lg:w-2/3">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand-green mb-8">
          Project Overview
        </h2>
        <div class="font-body text-lg text-gray-300 space-y-6">
          <p>
            Tomkinson is a British carpet brand with over a century of heritage,
            renowned for quality wool and synthetic carpets — including the
            best-selling Tomkinson Twist.
          </p>
          <p>
            Following the 2017 merger of Manx Carpets and Mr Tomkinson, the
            business needed a unified identity under the stronger Tomkinson
            name. The dual-branded Manx Tomkinson wasn't working — it split
            recognition, muddied the message, and made it harder to connect with
            a younger generation of buyers whose age profile the business needed
            to broaden.
          </p>
          <p>
            The challenge was significant: honour the heritage that existing
            stockists and customers valued, while building something modern
            enough to stand confidently in a competitive premium market.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:w-1/3 space-y-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Industry</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-gray-300">Retail</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Company size</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-gray-300">51-100 employees</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-4">What we did</h3>
          <ul class="font-body text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Identity Design</li>
            <li>Brand Guidelines</li>
            <li>Graphic Design</li>
            <li>Social Media</li>
            <li>Packaging</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our approach -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-24 px-8 border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand-green mb-8">
        Our approach
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-xl text-white mb-16 max-w-4xl leading-relaxed">
        We helped Tomkinson build a carpet brand identity that moved from a
        dual-branded past to a single, confident identity — retaining the equity
        that mattered while creating the clarity the business needed to move
        forward.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Brand Strategy</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
            Before touching the visual identity, we explored both a phased
            transition and a clean-break approach. The phased route won — it
            offered maximum market continuity while steadily building
            recognition for the unified Tomkinson name. That strategic decision
            shaped everything that followed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-6">The new identity</h3>
          <div
            class="font-body text-lg text-gray-300 space-y-6 max-w-4xl leading-relaxed"
          >
            <p>
              The new identity introduced a simplified brand name and lock-up,
              featuring an updated mark inspired by Tomkinson's hometown of
              Kidderminster — a subtle nod to the area's textile heritage and
              early Axminster patterns. The date of establishment was retained
              as a quiet confidence signal: we've been doing this for a very
              long time.
            </p>
            <p>
              The colour palette was refreshed to balance tradition with
              modernity — a new set of tones that feel contemporary without
              abandoning the warmth the brand had built. A flexible brand
              identity system was developed to work across everything from
              swatch packs and POS to brochures and digital campaigns.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="bg-brand-blue text-white py-16 px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
      <div class="mb-8 md:mb-0">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4 font-bold text-white">
          Want results like these?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-xl">
          Book a discovery call — 30 minutes to work out what you need and what
          it'll cost.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="bg-brand-navy text-white px-8 py-4 rounded font-bold font-heading text-lg hover:bg-brand-green hover:text-brand-navy transition-colors inline-block whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Book a fit call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- The Result -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-24 px-8 border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand-green mb-8">
        The Result
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-xl text-white mb-16 max-w-4xl leading-relaxed">
        A century-old carpet brand with a new chapter — one identity, clearly
        told, ready for the next generation.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-24">
        <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-3xl p-8 text-brand-navy">
          <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
            One brand, not two
          </h4>
          <p class="font-body">
            The post-merger dual identity resolved into a single, confident
            Tomkinson — clearer for stockists, clearer for customers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-3xl p-8 text-brand-navy">
          <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
            Recognised, but refreshed
          </h4>
          <p class="font-body">
            The rebrand retained what loyal customers recognise while giving new
            audiences a reason to take notice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-3xl p-8 text-brand-navy">
          <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
            A system that scales
          </h4>
          <p class="font-body">
            Guidelines, literature, swatch packs, social — a complete identity
            toolkit that works consistently across every touchpoint.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-3xl p-8 text-brand-navy">
          <h4 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">
            Built for the next chapter
          </h4>
          <p class="font-body">
            A brand with enough flexibility and confidence to carry Tomkinson
            into new markets without needing another rebrand.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl border-t border-gray-800 pt-12">
        <p class="font-heading text-2xl mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          "The rebrand has given Tomkinson a more confident and cohesive
          identity, without losing the heritage that makes it special. It
          strikes the right balance — modern, but unmistakably Tomkinson."
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-brand-green">
          Rachel Birbeck, Marketing Director — Tomkinson Carpets
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
